WEBVTT

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.090
What?

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:11.340
Mesto Meadrich lost his Crest
and his territories, you say?

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:12.930
And to whom?

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.930
A wandering Lord by the name of Theo.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:21.140
Also, he's making it known that he's joining
the Union rather than the Alliance.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:23.940
Oh? How fortunate.

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:31.700
Just when we're on the brink of war,
a Crest and territory come falling into our laps!

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:34.410
No time to lose, we move to attack!

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:36.660
I have no objections...

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:39.410
But you're talking about
a cross-border invasion.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.500
The Lords of Clovis will be sure
to give you an earful.

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:48.630
Once I seize that Crest and land,
it won't matter!

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:54.680
I can take one wandering Lord in my sleep!

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:31.820
You're telling me that
all this territory is mine now?

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:38.610
The three villages in this territory
have recognized you as their Lord.

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:40.870
They welcome you, in fact.

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:44.080
It seems they were being taxed too heavily.

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:46.660
There's no need to collect taxes!

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:50.710
But that's not how it works.
You'll need funds to run your territory.

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:56.300
All I wanted was a court rank
high enough to govern my hometown.

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:00.390
In terms of court rank,
you've likely met that goal.

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:03.930
Though I have no idea how big your village is.

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:07.350
It's a small, impoverished town.

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:13.940
We struggle just to survive there.
And still, too many end up dying.

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:18.280
I couldn't take it anymore, so I left the island.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:24.950
And you see that as having fled
your hometown?

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:27.410
Sometimes I feel that way.

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:32.210
And you suspect that becoming stronger
to save your village is just an excuse?

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.590
You really are relentless.

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:41.220
Well, that sets my mind at ease a little.
I'll stoop to any means to achieve my goals.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:48.220
And if you were the overly scrupulous type,
Lord Theo, that might not sit well with you.

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:54.110
What are the neighboring Lords up to?

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:58.740
Most likely, they're all vying
to be the first to seize this land.

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:03.870
Well, I'd be worried otherwise. We wouldn't
stand a chance if they joined forces.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:05.280
So tell me...

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:07.620
Who do you think will make the first move?

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:13.290
The Lord whose territory lies to the east.
The ruler of Savis, Lassic David, I would think.

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:16.800
Although he's of modest means,
he's extremely ambitious.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:20.760
He's already bolstered his troops for battle,
and even hired some mercenaries.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:24.430
Should we bring in
some mercenaries of our own?

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:25.550
No.

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:28.970
Under these circumstances,
I doubt anyone decent would show up.

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:34.520
I'm not crazy about the idea,
but I'm considering calling a friend.

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.610
Lady Siluca, you have friends?

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:40.030
Of course I do!
Don't look so surprised.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:45.280
I want you to continue monitoring our territory
and what's brewing nearby.

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:48.280
You may not have time to rest,
but I'm counting on you.

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:52.410
I accepted that the moment
I decided to serve you, Lady Siluca.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:56.670
Because I knew you'd run me into the ground.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:05.140
Thanks.

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:07.600
Now then...

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.310
Our worlds exist infinitely,
and shall never intersect.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:22.650
Still, dimensions will distort,
casting a shadow onto a parallel world.

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:24.990
Converge!

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:29.620
Cait Sith of Tír Na nÓg!

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:38.750
Long time no see.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:42.800
It's been a long time, Sir Balgary.

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:45.930
I grant you permission to pick me up.

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:48.720
And to rub me behind my ears.

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:51.350
I am honored.

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:01.360
So why did you summon me?

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:05.320
I want you to deliver a message
to Aishela for her to come here.

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:06.450
Aishela?

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:08.990
That woman makes me uncomfortable.

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:11.240
I am aware of that.

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:15.870
But I will thank you with
all your favorite foods on your return.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:19.000
That so?

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:25.340
In that case, I shall carry out your wish.

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:36.180
I see things look pretty hectic here.

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:40.650
Well, since there's no telling when
a neighboring Lord will attack us, so...

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:44.280
What's your intention in all this, exactly?

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:49.410
I sort of get that you didn't want
to enter a contract with the Lord of Artuk.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:53.540
Truth is, I didn't want
a contract with anybody.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:07:00.170
Those Lords always lust for Crests and power,
so it's a vicious cycle of conspiracy and war.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.920
I believe that whoever completes
the Emperor's Holy Seal,

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:08.840
and restores order to this world...

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:13.050
...must be someone like the First Lord Leon.

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:15.310
You mean the legendary hero?

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:20.310
Yes. A Lord like Leon,
who will never lose sight of his ideals.

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:22.230
That's whom I wish to serve.

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:24.520
Well, but my ideals are pretty trivial.

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:26.610
Trivial?

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:30.160
Wanting to bring bliss to an entire village
is not trivial at all.

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:34.450
And my goal is to make sure that happens.

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:37.450
And what's in it for you?

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.670
The chance to revel in my own talent!

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:46.960
Even after I've gained power, and I never
forget my ideals, you'll be fine with that?

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:49.420
That will do!

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:51.800
I'll take care of the rest.

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:57.390
What is it?

00:07:57.850 --> 00:08:00.100
Nothing. I'll leave everything to you.

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:03.150
I'll do whatever you say.

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:08.690
Thank you very much.

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:14.870
At last, the first step toward my ambition!

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:19.370
The enemy seized Meadrich's castle
with scant numbers.

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:21.370
I'm sure they've got some
skilled ones on their side.

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:24.080
If we're talking sword skills,
I'm no slouch either!

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:28.460
Behold the might of
these fifty expert troops I've trained.

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:30.340
Plus five mercenaries in the fold!

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:33.470
These forces are more than you can afford.

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:38.640
Then again, you did give up most of
the fortune your predecessor built up.

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:42.690
I just have to take Meadrich's land
to make the money back.

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:44.480
So I'm going all-in!

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.980
But if you lose, it all goes down the drain.

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:51.740
I just have to win. Am I wrong?

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:53.740
You're not wrong.

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:58.490
The issue is our opponents also have a mage.
So you're gonna have to pitch in, too.

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:02.210
Siluca Meletes, right?
I happen to know that one.

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:06.380
I mean, sure, she's gifted,
but nowhere near my level!

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:09.090
I knew I saw something special
in a mage like you!

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:17.010
Moreno, I'm asking you
to lend me your power.

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:20.680
I understand. Leave it to me.

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:24.270
Mobilize!

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:38.280
Ah, here they come now.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:40.410
What should I do?

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:42.000
Please stand here.

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:43.200
Huh?

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:45.790
Are you saying I don't have to fight?

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:57.010
Yes. Now I know the battle's a surefire win!

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:03.560
So you actually have a friend?

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:06.230
She was my senior
when we were apprentices.

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:09.940
Though, in the end,
she never did become a mage.

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:15.360
Siluca!

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.530
Sir Balgary!

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:24.410
Siluca!

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:29.670
Siluca!

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:31.040
L-Lord Theo, this is Aishela, an Artist.

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:32.840
Lord Theo?

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:37.220
Hey, who are you? What are you to Siluca?

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:39.090
My name is Theo.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:42.680
I'm the unfortunate Lord
she's under contract to.

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:45.560
You signed on with a loser like this?

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:48.190
Lord Theo happens to have
magnificent ideals.

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:49.480
And what else?

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:53.440
S-Such magnificent ideals, and uh...

00:10:55.240 --> 00:10:59.200
Oh! My poor Siluca!

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:59.200
Stop! Please!

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:04.660
I'm won't ask why Siluca
would serve someone like you.

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:05.500
However...

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:08.830
If you do anything unsavory to her
just because you're her master,

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:10.330
you're a dead man!

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:16.840
How are you feeling now, sir?

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:20.970
I'll live. I saw stars for
a moment, that's all.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:21.850
Who's that?

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:24.390
This is Sir Balgary.

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:27.640
He'll become king of the Cait Siths one day.

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:30.020
See to it that you make no blunders.

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:31.980
N-Nice to meet you.

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:33.860
Lucerne Hammer.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:36.690
You're my choice today.

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:45.410
Now, then...

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:48.000
Shall we dance?

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:05.010
By the way...

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:08.140
What's up with the outfit?

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:11.690
I don't have anything else
that's easy to move in!

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:13.400
It's all right, it's all right!

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:16.070
You're adorable no matter what you wear!

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:18.860
I do not see the enemy mage.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:21.860
He's using an Invisibility Spell.

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:28.790
I'm sure he's planning to swoop in
and attack after evaluating the situation.

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:31.250
Attack!

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:38.170
Aishela, to the right. Irvin, take center.

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:39.960
And I'll thwart them from the left.

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:44.840
I'm off!

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:49.560
All right, see you later.

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:57.360
You sure about this?

00:12:58.230 --> 00:13:01.990
The earth is unmoving.
Yet is not invariably so.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:05.530
The sea becomes land,
the land becomes mountain.

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:07.410
Rise up!

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:14.790
Let's go around!

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:20.170
Surge forth!

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:31.770
Sorry about that.

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:39.480
Oh? You evaded that?

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:43.240
I was trying to go a bit deeper.

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:47.910
It's been a while, Moreno.

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:51.830
You seem to be doing well, little Siluca.

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:54.910
<i>Was he targeting me from the start?</i>

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:57.710
Do you have time for this?

00:13:57.710 --> 00:14:02.010
While you dawdle here,
your Lord could get himself defeated.

00:14:02.010 --> 00:14:07.090
I'm aware of the situation.
You've got some formidable allies.

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:08.720
Fortunately, yes.

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:12.350
But if I take you hostage,
victory will be ours.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:17.600
You see, I'm hard to beat
in situations like these.

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:19.860
You might as well surrender, little Siluca.

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:22.940
You really think I'd surrender?

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:25.860
You haven't changed at all, huh?

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:29.160
Parry!

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:34.790
Abjuration Magic, huh?
But how long you can keep it up?

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:39.290
If you're already spent after just this,
it proves you have no talent as a mage!

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:47.550
Allow me to guide you to the afterlife!

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:51.930
Don't provoke her without thinking!

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:53.930
What? Not attacking?

00:14:53.930 --> 00:14:55.140
Fall back!

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:59.850
All I want is to make short work of them
so I can go to Siluca's aid.

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:01.980
So annoying!

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:13.580
So this is your doing, eh?

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:26.970
You put up a good fight!

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:47.030
Pierce her by going through me!

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:51.910
Whoa, whoa.

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:57.290
F-Fall back!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:03.920
Beyond annoying...
But I think I like him!

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:08.130
When this battle's over, let's be friends, okay?

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:31.280
You bastard! Are you a Shadow?

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:34.030
I am a footman.

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:39.160
So that's the toughest one to beat.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:41.250
Captain Gluck!

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:45.960
Hoo-haw!

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.810
Just as I thought,
it didn't work on him.

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:17.780
Damn you!

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:27.210
You seem pretty winded, little Siluca.

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:30.300
Right back at you.
Your strikes are becoming more labored.

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:33.680
Right, then I'll end this now.

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:36.430
Siluca!

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:39.680
Lord Theo!

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:41.890
What are you doing here?

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:45.480
This may be my first battlefield,
but even I can tell which side is losing.

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:48.570
I should've made my move sooner.

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:51.820
After all, as your Lord, this is my battle.

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:54.280
Right...

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:58.450
I'm your opponent!

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:00.870
Fine by me.

00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:08.170
So I guess you have
no intention of surrendering?

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:12.460
You actually think you can beat me
with these skills?

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:13.880
Sure I can!

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:15.970
You're out of breath!

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:18.510
And you're beginning to stumble!

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:27.560
Not now... I can't...

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:31.230
...allow myself to lose now!

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:39.740
Why don't you attack, damn it?

00:18:39.990 --> 00:18:42.240
Because I haven't found any openings.

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:44.750
In that case, allow me to–

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:46.250
Lord of the neighboring nation!

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:49.130
I have captured your mage!

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:52.840
Moreno!

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:54.840
This is absurd.

00:18:55.800 --> 00:19:00.140
Lord Lassic wouldn't even flinch
over having his mage caught.

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:23.030
I surrender!

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:28.790
I wish to become your subordinate.

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:30.170
Subordinate?

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.290
I think you can go ahead and accept.

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:34.380
Are you throwing away your ambition?

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:35.670
I would never.

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:40.180
If we serve this Lord, we'll never
be defeated at the hands of our neighbors.

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:43.760
If we play our cards right, Savis, Clovis,

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:46.680
as well as Forvis to the south,
could all be conquered.

00:19:47.140 --> 00:19:49.310
My ambition is not to become emperor.

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:54.480
Even if I'm serving another,
being able to reign over one nation is enough.

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:57.070
Your ambition is so paltry...

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:59.450
That's all I'm capable of.

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:02.700
Even so, it's something I can't do alone.

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:05.370
That's why I brought you onboard.

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:07.450
Lord Lassic...

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:11.710
I see you're under contract
to a fine Lord yourself.

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:14.750
That robe certainly becomes you.

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:19.720
Sir Lassic, I accept your proposal.

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:29.230
I, Lassic David, offer my Crest
to you as your own.

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:37.860
I, Theo, accept they Crest
and receive it as my own.

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:51.290
Congratulations!

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:54.790
Lord Theo has reached
the court rank of Baron,

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:58.380
and a subordinate Crest
has been granted to Sir Lassic.

00:20:59.010 --> 00:21:03.010
AMBITION

00:22:34.310 --> 00:22:37.400
That girl is prone to audacious action.

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:40.440
How would you have me deal with her?

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:43.570
To think an ignorant girl
would dare insult you, Lord Villar.

00:22:44.440 --> 00:22:49.120
Could you start by investigating
what her motivations could be?

00:22:49.660 --> 00:22:53.330
Then, if necessary, proceed to punish her.

00:22:53.330 --> 00:22:54.500
Understood.

00:22:57.750 --> 00:22:59.250
Won't you have a drink with me?

00:23:00.170 --> 00:23:02.800
I truly appreciate the offer, my Lord,

00:23:02.800 --> 00:23:06.550
but this issue with the Meletes girl
is of utmost urgency.

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:08.930
I see. That's unfortunate.

00:23:18.850 --> 00:23:23.150
No other man worships women as much as I.

00:23:23.900 --> 00:23:26.900
So why can't anyone live up
to my expectations?

00:23:28.530 --> 00:23:32.620
Meeting a woman like my mother
is no small feat, I see.

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:40.040
EPISODE 3:
BATTLE FLAG
